This directory is where Proton is pre-baked for the Live CD.

Run "bin/AddProton" from the BuildLiveCD repo root to download a prebuilt
Proton redistributable (default: GE-Proton11-3 from GloriousEggroll's GitHub
releases) and unpack it here. The Steam package then ships it under
/Users/root/.local/share/Steam/compatibilitytools.d/, so Steam finds it on
first launch without downloading anything.

After running AddProton, rebuild the Steam package with:
  CreatePackage Steam 1.0.0.87_bin

Note: Valve's official Proton releases are source-only since Proton 11
(prebuilt builds are delivered through the Steam client), which is why this
recipe uses the prebuilt GE-Proton distribution instead.
